== Locked Chest ==
{{infobox entity
 | name    = Locked Chest
 | variant = 60
}}

'''Locked Chests''' (or alternatively '''Golden Chests''') require a key to open unless Isaac has {{t|Paper Clip}} or a {{e|Golden Key}}; trying to open it without the means to will push the chest instead. When opened, they'll contain one of the following:
* Pickups: Follows the same pickup generation rules as normal chests, but spawns 2-6 batches of pickups instead. Mom's Key also causes an additional 2-6 batches to spawn from locked chests, increasing the total to 4-12.
* A [[Golden Chest (Item Pool)|Golden Chest item]]
* A [[trinket]]
* A [[Cards and Runes|card]]
* A smaller Chest

{{dlc+|r}} If Isaac has {{t|Gilded Key}}, all chest spawns will be replaced by Golden Chests and their contents will be modified to allow them to spawn trinkets, cards, and/or pills (which Golden Chests normally can't give) alongside normal pickups.{{dlc-}}

''See the following item pools for a list of items Golden Chests can contain:'' [[Golden Chest (Item Pool)]] and {{dlc|nr}}[[Golden Chest (Greed Mode Item Pool)]]
