== Red Chest ==
{{infobox entity
 | name    = Red Chest
 | variant = 360
}}

'''Red Chests''' are most commonly found in {{R|Curse Room}}s and {{R|Devil Room}}s, but can also occasionally replace normal chests. If Isaac is holding {{t|The Left Hand}} trinket, all chests will turn into Red Chests. They can contain the following:
* 2 {{e|Troll Bomb}}s
* 1 {{e|Mega Troll Bomb}}
* 2 {{E|Spider}}s {{dlc+|r}} or 2 {{E|Strider|dlc=n}}s in {{s|Downpour}}/{{s|Dross}}{{dlc-}}
* 1-2 {{e|Soul Heart}}s
* A [[Red Chest (Item Pool)|Red Chest pool item]]
* 1-2 [[pill]]s
* Teleport to the {{R|Devil Room}} or {{r|Angel Room}}
** If the Devil/Angel Room has not been encountered normally on the floor yet, it will actually change what's in the deal.
** {{dlc|a+}}Red Chests inside a Devil Room cannot teleport the player to the Devil Room.
* 1-3 [[Blue Fly|Blue Flies]]
* 1-3 [[Blue Spider]]s

Having the {{t|Daemon's Tail}} trinket changes the chances to get various rewards from a Red Chest.

