'''Mom's Chest''' appears in {{s|Home}}. Mom's Chest has no requirements to open. It contains a {{I|Red Key}} upon the first visit (used to access the [[Home#Hidden closet|hidden closet]]), and on later encounters, an item from the [[Mom's Chest (Item Pool)|Mom's Chest item pool]].

* Can't be copied by {{I|D1|dlc=x}}.
* Can't be duplicated with {{p|Jera}} or {{i|Diplopia}}.
{{clear}}{{dlc clear}}

== Notes ==
* Normal chests cannot contain [[card]]s or [[Golden Chest (Item Pool)|items]].
* Consider opening adjacent Red Chests before Stone Chests; Red Chests often contain {{e|Troll Bomb}}s, which can blast Stone Chests open.
** Stone Chests can also be pushed to any position in the room, which can be used to save bombs by hitting multiple targets with one blast.
* Opening any chest (except for red chests) while on {{s|Chest}} or {{s|Dark Room}} will spawn an [[item]].
* Chests of all types are considered pickups and will be doubled by {{p|Jera}}.
** Mom's Chest cannot be doubled.
* {{i|Mom's Key}} cannot change the contents of a chest; it only causes the chest to spawn more pickups if it normally would.
* Whenever a chest contains another chest, the smaller chest may also contain another chest. This can repeat as many times as the chance allows, but that chance is very slim by default. The smaller chest will have no different rewards than one of the same size.
** If these smaller chests contain an item, they will appear as tiny items.
* When using the Debug Console, a Golden Chest is referred to as a "Locked Chest" and a Stone Chest is referred to as a "Bomb Chest".
* {{dlc|nr}}All of the icons for the items in the Golden Chest pool are heads or, as is the case for {{i|Bob's Brain}} and {{i|Infamy}}, head-related.
** {{dlc|a+nr}}The Golden Chest pool also includes bags, such as {{i|IV Bag}} or {{i|Sack of Pennies}}.
* {{dlc|nr}}Empty opened chests may be rerolled into other pickups by using items such as the {{i|D20}}, but this must be done immediately, as opened chests will disappear upon leaving the room.
** {{dlc|r}}Opened chests cannot be rerolled.
* {{dlc|a+}}Prior to update [[v1.06.0182]], Mimic Chests looked identical to normal Chests.

